{"title":"Should we abolish mandatory quarterly corporate reporting?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/924888083/0/marginalrevolution~Should-we-abolish-mandatory-quarterly-corporate-reporting.html","date":1758005780000,"content":"<p>President Trump has suggested doing that.  I have not found a human source as good as GPT5, so I will cite that:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>Theory predicts that <em>more frequent</em> reporting can exacerbate managerial short‑termism; some archival evidence finds lower investment when reporting frequency rises. But when countries <em>reduced</em> frequency (UK/EU), the <strong>average</strong> firm’s investment <strong>didn’t materially change</strong>—in part because most issuers kept giving quarterly updates anyway…</p>\r\n<p><strong>Will markets just insist on quarterly anyway?</strong> That’s what happened in the <strong>UK</strong> and <strong>Austria</strong>: after rules allowed semi‑annual reporting, only a small minority actually stopped quarterly updates; those that did often saw <strong>lower liquidity</strong> and <strong>less analyst coverage</strong>. So yes—many issuers kept some form of quarterly communication to satisfy investors.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>There is much, much more <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://chatgpt.com/share/68c8a7b5-7294-8010-bf64-7e84a81f6465\" target=\"_blank\">at the link</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/should-we-abolish-mandatory-quarterly-corporate-reporting.html\">Should we abolish mandatory quarterly corporate reporting?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/924888083/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/924888083/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/924888083/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/924888083/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/924888083/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/924888083/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/should-we-abolish-mandatory-quarterly-corporate-reporting.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/should-we-abolish-mandatory-quarterly-corporate-reporting.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/should-we-abolish-mandatory-quarterly-corporate-reporting.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/should-we-abolish-mandatory-quarterly-corporate-reporting.html#comment-160963692\">I also doubt abolishing mandatory quarterly reports would ...</a> <i>by Vivian Darkbloom</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/should-we-abolish-mandatory-quarterly-corporate-reporting.html#comment-160963690\">Bread and circuses</a> <i>by WayneH</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/09/should-we-abolish-mandatory-quarterly-corporate-reporting.html#comment-160963688\">Trump kind of claimed that he wants more long-term investing ...</a> <i>by M</i><